 "intro": {
  "@es": "Hoy aprendes a presentar una solicitud o una queja formal: pedir un puesto, reclamar un pedido o pedir que revisen un caso. Son textos típicos de la vida administrativa y del comercio.",
  "@en": "Today you learn to file an application or a formal complaint: to request a post, to claim an order or to request a review of a case. They are typical texts of administrative life and trade."
